{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにゃちわっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみは一昨日、広島福岡に\nぐるぐるカーテンのＰＲ活動としてティッシュ配りをさせていただいた(^◇^)┛!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーは、さゆにゃん、まいやん、みなみ、あみの４人で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/flair.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の人も福岡の人も本当に暖か～く迎えてくださって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウルっときてしまったのだ。\nプレゼントやお手紙、優しいお言葉もたくさん頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行かせてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆☆\nさて、今日のお題でもある、\n「爪」に関してお話させてください……"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみねー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の爪がどうにもこうにも好きになれましぇん。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって……………"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/31/120131_00370020001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちぃっちゃいんだよ～～～～～!!!!!!!\nやたら小さくて真ん丸くて、\n切ったから余計にしじみみたいでなんかお恥ずかしい（笑）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/heart03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみはね、女性らしい縦長の細くて綺麗な爪に憧れてるんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"………………すごくくだらないお話（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな最後まで聞いてくれてありがとーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、見たいって人いたら握手会の時に特別にお見せしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/sign03.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/31/img_8435.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答は明日しまっす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/confident.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好きだよっ"}],"source":"archive"}